<v News>地元の人たちは、「とてもうれしい」と話しています。

00:06:21.803 --> 00:06:24.540
<v Host>Quiz time. Three questions.

00:06:25.139 --> 00:06:31.620
<v Slow>「飛鳥・藤原の宮都」は、どこにありますか。

00:06:32.420 --> 00:06:36.500
<v Host>Where is Asuka-Fujiwara? In Nara Prefecture.

00:06:37.100 --> 00:06:42.283
<v Slow>昔、ここには何がありましたか。

00:06:43.084 --> 00:06:47.980
<v Host>What was here long ago? The emperor's palace — it was Japan's capital.

00:06:48.579 --> 00:06:53.908
<v Slow>正式な登録は、いつ決まりますか。

00:06:54.708 --> 00:07:01.043
<v Host>When will the official registration be decided? In July, in Busan, South Korea.

00:07:01.644 --> 00:07:14.028
<v Host>That's today's Japanese Daily News. Full transcript with furigana at podcast.jpnotes.dev. Subscribe on Apple Podcasts or Spotify. See you tomorrow.

